{
    "ID":"2G31",
    "dest":["8BD", "9BA", "EAA"],
    "type":"text",
    "title":"Steigung einer Geraden durch zwei Punkte",
    "description":"Steigung m einer Geraden aus den Koordinaten zweier Punkte berechnen, Differenzenquotient, Steigungsdreieck, lineare Funktion",
    "consts":{"lettres":["A","B","C","D","E","F","G","H","J","K","L","M","N","P","Q","R","S","T","U","V","W"]},
    "options":[{
        "name":"Positive ganzzahlige Steigung",
        "vars":{ "y2":"0_10", "y1":"0_${:y2}", "x1":"0_10", "x2":"${MMmath.unDiviseur(:y2-:y1)+:x1}",
        "pente":"${(:y1-:y2)/(:x1-:x2)}",
        "cl":"0_20_2_^&", "A":"${:lettres[:cl[0]]}","B":"${:lettres[:cl[1]]}"
        }
    }, {
        "name":"Negative ganzzahlige Steigung",
        "vars":{ "y2":"-10_10", "y1":"${:y2}_10", "x1":"-10_10", "x2":"${MMmath.unDiviseur(:y2-:y1)+:x1}",
        "pente":"${(:y1-:y2)/(:x1-:x2)}",
        "cl":"0_20_2_^&", "A":"${:lettres[:cl[0]]}","B":"${:lettres[:cl[1]]}"
        }
    }, {
        "name": "Steigung als Bruch",
        "vars":{ "y2":"-10_10", "y1":"-10_10_^${:y2}", "x1":"-10_10", "x2":"${:x1+MMmath.nonDiviseur(Math.abs(:y2-:y1), true)}",
        "pente":"${MMmath.fractionSimplifiee(:y2-:y1,:x2-:x1)}",
        "cl":"0_20_2_^&", "A":"${:lettres[:cl[0]]}","B":"${:lettres[:cl[1]]}" 
        }
    }],
    "question":"Berechne die Steigung der Geraden durch die Punkte $$${:A}(${:x1}|${:y1})$$ und $$${:B}(${:x2}|${:y2})$$.",
    "answer":"$$m=\\dfrac{${:y2}-${:y1>=0?:y1:'('+:y1+')'}}{${:x2}-${:x1>=0?:x1:'('+:x1+')'}}=\\color{red}{${:pente}}$$",
    "value":"${:pente}"
}